flowchart TD
    A([Admin]) --> B[Menu Users]
    B --> C[Daftar User non-admin]
    C --> D{Aksi}
    D -->|Tambah| E[Form: Nama, Username, Password, Role]
    E --> F{Role = Wali Kelas?}
    F -->|Ya| G[Pilih Kelas] --> H[Simpan User + Assign di tabel Kelas]
    F -->|Tidak| H2[Simpan User Langsung]
    D -->|Edit| I[Form Edit User]
    I --> J{Kelas Berubah?}
    J -->|Ya| K[Auto-Handover: Cabut wali lama, Assign baru]
    J -->|Tidak| L[Update Data User Saja]
    D -->|Hapus| M[Cek role bukan admin] --> N[Hapus + Clear kelas assignment]
